# EXTRA RACES #
# Race IDs are handed out in this order (Goblin is 9, Worgen 12, then 13 up; Gilnean is NPC-only at 213, F-027), and
# 32-bit race masks only hold races 1-31 (helmet masks use bit <race>). F-051 above is race 31, so enable no more
# races here without turning another one off (build-dbc.sh stops if you do).
#F-005_mod-azerothcore-high-elf # Off in 32-bit (over the cap: race masks stop at 31)
#F-014_mod-playable-ogres # Off in 32-bit (over the cap: race masks stop at 31)
